 "context": "<figure id=\"fig-ch06_02_03\"><span data-type=\"media\" id=\"fs-id2155472\" data-alt=\" Four photos show (a) a compost pile, (b) a baby chick emerging from a fertilized egg, (c) sand art, and (d) a ball rolling downhill.\">\n<img src=\"https://openstax.org/apps/archive/20260407.195030/resources/a54ac2785d446ae7b43a903b5fcf821f25b9c0ba\" data-media-type=\"image/png\" alt=\" Four photos show (a) a compost pile, (b) a baby chick emerging from a fertilized egg, (c) sand art, and (d) a ball rolling downhill.\" width=\"400\" height=\"320\">\n</span>\n</figure>",
